<title>SINGAPORE: Pengkalen plans rights issue with warrants.</title>
<headline>Pengkalen plans rights issue with warrants.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pengkalen Investments Ltd said on Wednesday it was proposing a rights issue of 35.6 million new shares with 5.93 warrants.</p>
<p>The investment holding company said the rights will be made on the basis of six rights shares with one warrant for every four existing shares.</p>
<p>The rights shares will be priced at Singapore $1 a share while the warrants will be free.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
